WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.690
Capsule 22 opened, and someone awaited for centuries stepped out.

2
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.350
Leon, Leon, can you hear me?

3
00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.330
Who are you? Where is this?

4
00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.850
It's me, AyShe. We came to save you.

5
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.870
I don't remember anything. Just a number. 22.

6
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.640
His memory core has been erased. Someone did it on purpose.

7
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:30.670
Leon's mind was like a blank page. But his heart remembered AyShe.

8
00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:35.910
But the surprises weren't over. Two more capsules in the hall began to glow.

9
00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:39.030
11 and 12. They're waking up too.

10
00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:43.050
I can breathe. How long did I sleep?

11
00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.790
Long enough. Get up. We're not safe here.

12
00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:50.110
Wow! The capsules are opening one by one.

13
00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.500
Sergeant! Come here, boy!

14
00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:59.310
Aslı's loyal cat, Sergeant, never lost his way, even in the darkest corridor of the fortress.

15
00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:02.310
The cat's helmet is cooler than mine. I admit it.

16
00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.930
All the doors of the fortress locked at once.

17
00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.210
Then the lights turned red. And a cold voice echoed through the hall.

18
00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:16.130
So you've woken up. Number 22, you are my property.

19
00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.330
And who are you?

20
00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.700
My name is Sila. I built this fortress. The Shadow is my creation.

21
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.710
Take Leon. Freeze the others.

22
00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.610
I woke up to find Leon. I won't leave him to anyone.

23
00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:32.210
Anka and Mony leapt forward to protect Leon.

24
00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:35.330
The door on the right. The capsule controls are there.

25
00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:38.990
Shield at 40 percent. 90 seconds to the exit.

26
00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.550
Robots are coming. Lots of them.

27
00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:45.410
Sergeant jumped on a robot and blinded its sensor.

28
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.840
Good boy, Sergeant. Run.

29
00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:51.450
I know this woman. I used to see her in my dreams.

30
00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:54.830
You can run, but you can't hide.

31
00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.850
Leon, sooner or later you'll come back to me.

32
00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:00.270
The tunnel is open. Get in now.

33
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:04.010
The team escaped through the old tunnel beneath the fortress.

34
00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:09.090
Leon, you're safe now. I promise we'll bring your memory back.

35
00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.710
I don't know why, but I trust you.

36
00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:17.360
I'm Mony. Number 11. We're part of this team now.

37
00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:21.790
As the sun rose, the team breathed freely for the first time.

38
00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:26.090
And I'm Anka. I woke up to find Leon, and I won't let him go.

39
00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.450
But from the top of the fortress, Sila was watching everything.

40
00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.650
The game is only beginning.

41
00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:37.150
New friends, an old enemy, and a lost memory.

42
00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.390
The story was only just beginning.

43
00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:43.790
The journey now led to the door of the old guardian, Kael.

